# Cloudflare redirects. Copied to the site root by the build.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Cloudflare already handles the two redirects Apache needed rules for:
#   - HTTP to HTTPS, on every request
#   - /ranking.html to /ranking, because an .html file is served extension-less
#
# It cannot do www to apex here: _redirects matches paths only, never hostnames.
# That one is a Redirect Rule in the dashboard, see README.

# Belt and braces for anyone who links the page with a trailing slash.
/ranking/ /ranking 301
